[I] Port of http_parser to llparse

[T] llhttp is a port of the http_parser library to llparse, which generates
[T] the C parser from a TypeScript description. It is more maintainable and
[T] faster than http_parser and is the HTTP parser used by Node.js.

[U] https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp

[A] nodejs
